\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Son of God, eternal Saviour,
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0\qj Source of life and truth and grace,
\par Son of Man, whose birth incarnate
\par Hallows all our human race;
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0\qj Thou, our Head, who, throned in glory,
\par For Thine own dost ever plead,
\par Fill us with Thy love and pity,
\par Heal our wrongs, and help our need.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  As Thou, Lord, has lived for others,
\par \pard\li225\sl200\slmult0 So may we for others live;
\par Freely have Thy gifts been granted,
\par Freely may Thy servants give.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Thine the gold and Thine the silver,
\par Thine the wealth of land and sea,
\par We but stewards of Thy bounty,
\par Held in solemn trust for Thee.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   3.  Come, O Christ, and reign among us,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj King of love, and Prince of peace;
\par Hush the storm of strife and passion,
\par Bid its cruel discords cease.
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj Ah, the past is dark behind us,
\par Strewn with wrecks and stained with blood;
\par But before us gleams the vision
\par Of the coming brotherhood.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  See the christlike host advancing,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 High and lowly, great and small,
\par Linked in bonds of common service.
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj For the common Lord of all.
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj Thou who prayedst, Thou who willest
\par  That Thy people should be one,
\par Grant, O grant our hope's fruition:
\par \pard      Here on earth Thy will be done.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

